{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123411","id":4505367645,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDIp0XQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123411","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123411.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123411.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123411","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123411/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123411/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123411/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/9d671acdf649528f58c4b39f8fac143dbe304aa5","number":123411,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"3D Editor: Add a new `AABB`-based focusing method","user":{"login":"JekSun97","id":130399274,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8W8Kg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130399274?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97","html_url":"https://github.com/JekSun97","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Adds a new focusing method to the 3D editor based on the node's `AABB` center.\r\n\r\nCurrent focus (The old hotkey was **F**; in this PR, it is now **Ctrl+F**):\r\n\r\n<video src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e861b4e4-c494-4396-b251-6669291e04fb\" controls width=\"400\"></video>\r\n\r\nThis PR (Hotkey **F**):\r\n\r\n<video src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2259738d-dd0b-4114-8ed0-253d73ed642a\" controls width=\"400\"></video>\r\n\r\n**Edited.**\r\nUniform zooming added:\r\n<video src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c7fbf80f-afc9-430b-99fa-aa99a74c4467\" controls width=\"400\"></video>\r\n\r\nWe focus on a specific visual component of the content, even if its anchor point is far away.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes [Add AABB-based node focus mode](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15507).\r\n- Closes [Add Frame Selection functionality to the 3D editor](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13447)\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI noticed that they have started trying to use `LocalVector` within the engine core, so I used it as well.\r\n\r\nAI intelligence was used to locate the file specifying the hotkey (**F**).\r\n\r\nThe 3D model is taken from [here](https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/ponytail-hair-for-character-8ddc5c1c6cda49bc80c9f3a675b0a6c4).\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":